Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.00,CN,,0,0,0,,全场一起大笑 —— 最暖的瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.00,EN,,0,0,0,,The whole room bursts into laughter — the warmest moment
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:10.50,CN,,0,0,0,,延庆路上的咖啡店外，早上开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:10.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Outside the cafe on Yanqing Road, the morning begins
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:12.00,CN,,0,0,0,,为第一场分享搭起屏幕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:12.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Setting up the screen for the first talk
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.50,CN,,0,0,0,,吧台上摆满了咖啡，等着大家来拿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.50,0:00:13.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Coffee cups lined up on the bar, ready for the crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.00,CN,,0,0,0,,幻灯片亮起，房间里人渐渐多了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Slides up on the screen as the room fills in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,CN,,0,0,0,,观众落座，找到自己的位置
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.50,0:00:16.50,EN,,0,0,0,,The audience settles in, finding their seats
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:21.00,CN,,0,0,0,,两位主持人在 Cursor 横幅前竖起大拇指
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:21.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Two hosts pose at the Cursor banner, thumbs up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:25.50,CN,,0,0,0,,朋友们在街边聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.50,0:00:25.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Friends chatting on the street outside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:30.00,CN,,0,0,0,,从街边走进来，走进热闹的人群
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.00,0:00:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Walking in from the street, into the buzz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:36.50,CN,,0,0,0,,周六早上满屋的人，大家都聚精会神
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.50,0:00:36.50,EN,,0,0,0,,A full room on a Saturday morning, everyone leaning in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:44.00,CN,,0,0,0,,分享 A —— 用 AI 原生工具搭建
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.00,0:00:44.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Talk A — building with AI-native tools
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:53.50,CN,,0,0,0,,她在台上现场演示自己的手机应用
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.50,0:00:53.50,EN,,0,0,0,,She demos her phone app live, right on stage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:01:02.00,CN,,0,0,0,,分享 F —— 你的品牌更懂你，用 AI 智能体
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:01:02.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Talk F — your brand knows more, with AI agents
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:09.50,CN,,0,0,0,,现场写代码，当着所有人的面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.50,0:01:09.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Live code, written on stage in front of everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:17.00,CN,,0,0,0,,分享 M —— 智能体替你工作，睡觉也在干活
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.00,0:01:17.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Talk M — your agents work while you sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:23.50,CN,,0,0,0,,分享 L —— Pairoa，AI 应用现场演示
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:23.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Talk L — Pairoa, an AI app, demoed live
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:27.00,CN,,0,0,0,,认真倾听，不放过每一句话
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.00,0:01:27.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Listening closely, hanging on every word
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:33.50,CN,,0,0,0,,现场提问，大家纷纷举手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.50,0:01:33.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Questions from the room, hands going up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:40.00,CN,,0,0,0,,关于 ARIAVA 的提问，大家都凑了过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:40.00,EN,,0,0,0,,A question about ARIAVA, and the room leans in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:44.50,CN,,0,0,0,,生动的分享，满屋笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.50,0:01:44.50,EN,,0,0,0,,An animated presenter, and a room full of smiles
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:48.00,CN,,0,0,0,,下次再见，就在横幅前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:48.00,EN,,0,0,0,,See you next time, at the banner
